WEBVTT

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.390
Morning, sorry for the wait.

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.440
Let's go.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.740
And I ended up buying it.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.490
Good morning!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.930
It was his birthday.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:25.880
What did you do?

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.290
I made him a cake.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.090
Amazing!

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:35.540
Do you like them bigger or smaller?

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:52.620
Oh,

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:55.090
a cherry blossom petal.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.370
I heard that cherry blossom petals
in your tea can bring good luck.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.370
I hope something good happens...

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:16.770
Something good happened!

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:22.820
Ousai Academy.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:24.640
Student Council Rules.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:27.700
Article Two, section Twenty-three.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:31.620
Step on it, step on it with love.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.570
I swear, you're always like this!

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.420
You broke up with Shiraishi-kun, right? Good on you.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:15.110
How's it going with Tone-kun?

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:16.020
Tone-k...

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.750
Sorry about this, Tsuda-kun.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.840
No problem, I am from the Student Council after all.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.230
Can you put that over there please.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:27.100
Ok.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.840
Then I'll leave the rest to you.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:32.700
You don't have to lock the door.

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:33.590
Got it.

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:48.870
That was really cheap, don't worry about it.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.370
Still, I'm sorry.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:52.930
There's glue in the preparation room.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:54.610
You can fix it with that.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:55.650
Goodbye.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:56.630
Right...

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.720
Did something break?

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.900
That doesn't look good at all, you're bleeding!

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.960
This is only glue.

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.610
On my hand.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.000
Shino-chan, should we leave it here?

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.350
No, this should be in the preparation room.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.060
Art teachers are always so lazy.

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.270
Hurry up, we have to think of something!

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.170
Why are you two arm wrestling?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:02.760
Stare~

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.530
And that's what happened.
Stare~

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.800
Oh my.
Stare~

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.000
Stare~

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.600
We can separate you with hot water...

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:12.160
But we have a meeting soon, so we don't have enough time.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:16.630
If the head of the disciplinary committee and
a boy are caught holding hands...

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.440
Everyone's gonna look at me wide-eyed!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:27.180
This kind of white eyes is quite cute.
Note: Pun is between wide-eyed and white-eyed.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.260
Thank you for relaxing the atmosphere!

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.910
The issue of excess noise from the
wind ensemble and light music club,

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.320
has been resolved by closing the windows.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.350
That's the end of the Cultural Committee's report.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:42.650
Is it now ok to put your right hand between your legs?

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.310
I can get it with my left hand.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.560
Next is the report by the Sports Association Committee.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:53.940
It mentions that the grounds get
filled with bird droppings during practice.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.830
That could be troublesome.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:59.580
Should we place balloons as bird repellent?

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.170
That's a great idea!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.820
Ok, everyone, let's go do it right away!

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:06.170
Yo~

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.800
This is hard for you, isn't it?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.670
Don't look so smug.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.840
Shino-chan, you inhaled the balloon.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:38.760
Helping people put on their "balloons"
is quite satisfying, isn't it?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:40.960
Don't jump to conclusions!

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:45.810
Gurgle~ Gurgle~

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.910
Looks like it's bubbling nicely.
Gurgle~ Gurgle~

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:47.970
Looks like it's bubbling nicely.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.870
Um, yeah...

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.350
The hot water will burn through it right away.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:55.260
Sorry to leave you with such a bad experience today.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.560
No, I…

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.750
I didn't really mind.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.500
Annnnd drop of hot water.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.710
Hot, hot, hot, I'm dead!

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:12.160
I only got a C in Home Economics.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.760
I really can't do this.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.940
You can only accumulate experience.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.780
'Kay. Let's gain some experience with this!

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:32.570
Ok then, this is your new manager.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.490
Tsuda Kotomi-san!

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:36.720
Nice to meet you all!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:40.620
Your jobs are: to clean the club room
and wash the uniforms.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.830
That's an easy task.

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:44.570
Collect intelligence on rival schools.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:46.110
Does that make me a spy?

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:49.400
By the way, what does Takatoshi-kun like to eat the most?

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:53.010
She won't be able to collect private information.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.210
Can Kotomi really be a good manager?

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.120
Let's go and see.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.960
Kotomi, are you working hard?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.950
My back hurts.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:04.710
Oh no.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.090
I will lend you my vacuum cleaner.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.710
Why were you carrying that with you?

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.090
I am very interested in vacuums.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:15.140
In any case, the school rules are definitely violated!

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.230
Alright, let's get started.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:23.380
Okay~

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.880
Can my top be repaired?

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.480
Let me try.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.610
I carry my sewing kit with me.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.990
Wow, you're so prepared.

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.430
It's because I can also use my fists.

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:36.830
I'll do the sewing.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.940
Her grappling technique is really good.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.370
So cool!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.380
I really admire her too.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:47.780
Then I can teach you~

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.810
This is a sleeper hold.

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.130
Hold from behind?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.390
That's it for today.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.390
Good work!

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.110
I'm so tired.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.930
I want to take a shower.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.880
Make sure to wash everything.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.150
Okay~

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.330
So refreshing~

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:22.410
Where are my panties?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.580
Downhearted
It's so cold.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.090
I am really sorry.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:37.900
That's okay. Admitting to one's mistakes is a good thing.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.660
You'll do better in the future.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:40.600
Right!

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:44.100
Did something happen? You're all fidgeting.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:46.940
Everyone's panties got wet.

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.610
You need to explain further!

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:59.010
Ah, we still have to play this?

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:02.620
I didn't notice the time, I thought it was over.

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:04.350
Then let's wrap this up quick.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:05.740
Yeah.

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.840
You two seem very motivated.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.890
We just want to end soon!

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.880
Really now, you're so impatient.

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:13.930
This time, what is this?

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.940
This actually looks kinda normal.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.810
Let's spring the trap and see what it is.

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.100
Cloud?

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:22.570
I wonder... smoke?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.470
Doesn't look like it has a fixed shape.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:28.220
Tsuda-kun is on the right track.

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.730
The answer is...

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:34.340
Udon noodles heated to near body temperature.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.910
I still don't understand the serious answer.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:38.610
Now then...

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.170
Tsuda-kun, try using it.

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:43.030
Use? Not eat?

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:44.620
I have a bad feeling.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.710
Yeah, think I'll pass.

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:53.200
Would you prefer a rotten melon with a hole or soggy cup noodles?

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.530
More and more things I don't understand!

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:57.920
I don't get it, but you shouldn't spoil food! Ever!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.680
High school student film contest?

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:06.180
Yes, our film club also wants to go to the competition.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:11.060
So we'd like student council members to
play the hero and heroine.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.700
I'm a little shy.

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:15.700
Me too.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:19.360
Although I like shame, I'm shy also.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.890
Tsuda-kun, what do you think?

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.430
I don't want to either, but

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:28.120
it wouldn't do for everyone to refuse.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.470
Understood, I'll do it.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.370
Thank you.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.850
Oh well, I'll do it too.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:35.650
Me too.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.030
Then I am coming too.

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:38.380
What happened?!

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.200
Yokoshima-sensei.

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.570
We want to apply to use the multi-purpose room.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.640
What do you need it for?

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.650
We're going to participate in a film contest.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.400
So I want to have an audition for the heroine.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.870
Not allowed!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:03.100
A heroine audition sounds like an AV setup.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:07.410
Koyama-sensei, we want to book the multi-purpose room.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.670
I am No. 1, Amakusa Shino.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:16.520
Then please play out this scene with the hero.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:17.170
Ok.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.260
Um...

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:22.880
This scene has a lot of physical contact.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.640
Then, if you would.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:31.750
You are always like this.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.580
Always so kind towards her.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.430
That's...

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:40.150
not because she means that much to me.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.860
Then you have to

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.260
be kind to me too.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:58.170
Tsuda’s chest is hard.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.860
He must be working out.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.360
President, your line?

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:08.680
Oh, sorry.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:12.160
Tsuda’s hard thing is on my back. I'm a bit anxious.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:14.640
It's not though!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.180
I am No. 2, Mitsuba Mutsumi.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.430
I take pride in my training.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.730
She would make a good stunt-woman.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.700
Alright! Next!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.250
How was it?

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:42.420
They asked me to cry for them, I couldn't do it.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:46.190
A proper audition would ask for such talents.

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:49.430
Ok then.

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:49.450
I will show them the moving cry that Dejima-san taught me.
Ok then.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:54.670
I will show them the moving cry that Dejima-san taught me.

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:55.990
Next person, please!

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:57.270
Coming!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.190
It's probably best to stop her now.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.830
Those auditions are taking place right now.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:04.190
Lets go take a look.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.830
Sure enough, she is auditioning for AV.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.290
That's not possible...

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.740
...is it?

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:18.210
I am the 13th Candidate, Hagimura Suzu.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:20.800
That school is co-ed?

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.810
It used to be girls only.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:26.140
So there must be more girls.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.630
Even if the first-year male and female ratio is balanced,

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.670
the second and third years are all girls.

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:33.220
The number of girls is at least five times that of the boys.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.600
This is almost the same as a girls' school!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.830
Amazing, she remembered all her lines.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.110
Really worthy of that 180 IQ.

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:45.400
But you are the most important person to me.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.610
M-m-m-me, too...

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.240
But she's in tatters in front of Tsuda.

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.720
Isn't it strange?

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.660
What is the reason for choosing Hagimura-san?

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:01.380
Well,

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.240
her height.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:04.000
Huh?

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.030
Didn't I mention that?

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.620
The male and female leads are actually siblings.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:10.380
I fell.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:14.420
And so, they shot a movie about an established
girls' high school that turned co-ed,

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:16.720
and a brother and sister who are hilariously dragged into all sorts of situations.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.490
What should I do now?

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:19.330
and a brother and sister who are hilariously dragged into all sorts of situations.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.900
Big brother!

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:24.700
Let's go home together.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:29.040
Sorry, I forgot my line.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.450
Cut!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.910
Get it together.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.970
I guess I have to go again.

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.410
She seems to enjoy this scene.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.510
I fell in love with you at first sight!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.850
Cut!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.960
I'd like you to put on a more bashfulness expression.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:49.170
That's really difficult.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:52.980
This scene is just filming the upper body, right?

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:53.950
Yes.

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.360
If the lower body is naked,

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.420
you could make a more bashful expression.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:01.010
That's too great a sacrifice!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:05.710
Huh?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.500
This mic isn't very loud.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.580
Is it broken?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:14.170
That's troubling, we need a mic for this scene.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.870
If you increase the actor's sensitivity,

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:20.370
wouldn't it improve their voice and tone?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.100
Crap, she's looking my way.

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.690
The film club
is shooting
here now.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.470
You're an extra, don't look at the camera.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:34.410
You should straighten up too, Toki.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.880
I don't really care.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:39.740
Your bra'll be poking out when they get your back.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.980
Just leave it to big sis~

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.380
CG technology is amazing.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:51.990
With a little bit of effort, we can make the picture shine.

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.320
Even this staring scene.

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:58.310
If you add a saliva trail, it leaves quite the impression.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.340
Stop it now!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.750
Big brother, you idiot!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.840
Amazing, its like you're not acting at all.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.000
No, no~

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.180
Here too.

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:10.500
Big brother, I love you!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.990
That is acting!

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:13.170
Oh...

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.590
We're done filming for the day.

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:18.030
Thanks for your hard work!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.260
Good work!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:23.130
Tomorrow is a day off, but we're still filming.

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:24.150
Thanks in advance.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.770
Okay.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.550
Tsuda, don't sleep in.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.630
I think it's fine to sleep in.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.160
Tomorrow we're filming at night.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:50.350
Too sleepy, can't switch myself on.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:51.800
You have to.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.380
Todoroki is always switched on.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.800
Not her so much as her toy.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:17:59.840
What are you talking about?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.040
Just that I can't switch it on.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:03.520
A spiritual phenomenon!?

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.620
Ah, sorry, I left out some words!

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.060
Tickle, tickle, tickle~

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:08.080
Have you relaxed?
Tickle, tickle, tickle~

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.630
Have you relaxed?

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.070
President, come on.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:18.960
Geez, suddenly attacking the G-spot on my chest.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:24.360
Good evening. I have come with refreshments.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:26.710
Thank you very much.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.410
Looks delicious!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.460
Thank you, Dejima-san.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.590
Not a problem.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.710
Its fun making a movie.

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.530
I was once an extra.

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.860
Do you want to join us extras?

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.720
I have changed since then.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:45.750
My face would be censored anyway.
I have changed since then.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:48.030
My face would be censored anyway.

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:50.270
We are not shooting an AV!

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:55.980
Are we really doing this?

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:00.040
It is necessary if we are to
express the reality of youth!

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:02.490
It's all fake, by the way.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:05.280
You know how they use fake stabs in historical dramas?

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:06.760
This is the same as that.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.250
Right... let's do it like that.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.570
In between the legs will do!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.400
President, calm down and think it over!

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:39.690
Although this is just acting,

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:41.380
I'm still very nervous.

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:45.740
It h-h-h-h-hurts!!!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.810
Huh?!

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:48.540
I didn't put it in!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.300
Okay, cut!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.530
They're feeling down because of that mess-up.

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:57.550
I will go and comfort them.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:02.200
My legs cramped up during production also.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:06.110
But it turned out alright, since it was my first time and all.

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:13.020
Okay.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.400
We are done!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.190
Good work, everyone.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.740
I'm exhausted, cant move at all.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.510
Want me to lend a shoulder?

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:26.810
Thank you.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.550
Snore~

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:30.950
Is this how she leans?

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.250
Job well done.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:53.890
It's all the way up there.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.880
Leave it to me.

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.550
Is she going to get a footstool?

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.160
Over here.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.490
A person?!

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:10.500
What's up?

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:13.040
I need you to take down that box.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.020
Oh, that's easy enough.

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.310
Here you go.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:20.380
Thank you.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.940
So, do you want to join the Student Council?

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.260
I've had my eye on you.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:29.160
President, that's a bit sudden and rude.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.260
Even if you want to have boys in the council.

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:33.380
I'm a woman.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:35.270
I'm so sorry!

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:39.270
I don't really mind. People often make that mistake.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.300
And this body won't lose to any boy!

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.030
Stiff.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:49.450
Oh, everyone is here.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:52.260
Stiff lower belly.

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:54.960
Everyone here is a woman!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:01.690
Our student council definitely wants
that magnificent body of yours.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.970
Would you please consider it?

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:09.210
I wanted to do the thing but my thigh can't even reach~

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:12.470
Its great for a plan like that to fail.

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:14.400
Now we have four.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:16.480
It's going to get lively.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:20.820
Um, I also have the activities
with the volleyball team.

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:23.110
You should give priority to them.

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.860
Come here when you have the time.

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:26.760
Aren't you in the middle of club activities right now?

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:29.090
Won't you get in trouble if you're late?

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:30.870
It's okay.

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:33.480
I just told them I was taking a bathroom break.

00:22:34.110 --> 00:22:37.010
Everyone must think that I am pooping.

00:22:38.530 --> 00:22:42.390
As a girl, you could have a little more shame...

00:22:42.990 --> 00:22:46.520
This is not a ghost member, but a ghost officer.

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:47.880
Yes.

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:50.020
A new member, you say?

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:52.890
Yes, a hopeful rookie.

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:54.400
You should introduce us.

00:22:54.620 --> 00:22:57.310
That's not really possible at this time.

00:22:57.310 --> 00:22:58.720
Because they're a ghost.

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:03.050
Hello there.

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:05.570
Is he the new member?

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.240
Its "her".

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:09.320
I'm sorry.

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:13.290
If you're suspicious, you can test me out.

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:14.600
Guy over there.

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:19.180
See? There's no apple.

00:23:19.400 --> 00:23:20.790
Oh, ok.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:33.160
I've grown taller recently.

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:38.320
I grew up too!

00:23:38.690 --> 00:23:40.570
I can recite pi longer then before!

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:46.320
Its so fast, I don't know if its right!

00:25:20.500 --> 00:25:21.680
Big brother,

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:26.080
I want to be with you forever.

00:25:28.080 --> 00:25:30.090
The one destined for you is:

00:25:30.590 --> 00:25:31.840
Your little sister.

00:25:33.990 --> 00:25:35.510
That's not good at all.

00:25:36.470 --> 00:25:39.040
I will cut that red string of fate.

00:25:41.880 --> 00:25:44.680
For I hold the power to change your destiny.

00:25:44.680 --> 00:25:46.130
What did you say!?

00:25:46.560 --> 00:25:48.770
In that case, become my husband!

00:25:50.060 --> 00:25:51.920
You need to create your own destiny!

00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:57.200
Big brother!

00:26:08.210 --> 00:26:10.970
It makes one proud to be a student of Ousai.

00:26:12.210 --> 00:26:16.570
The film club, which lived in the shadows until yesterday, finally saw the light.

00:26:16.570 --> 00:26:17.720
Good for you.

00:26:18.410 --> 00:26:19.830
Back to the shadows.

00:26:22.940 --> 00:26:24.600
Ah, stop there.

00:26:24.610 --> 00:26:25.010
Sure enough, there are many kinds of hard and soft...

00:26:25.010 --> 00:26:27.350
This scene was shot with a drink in the back.

00:26:27.350 --> 00:26:27.810
Sure enough, there are many kinds of hard and soft...

00:26:27.810 --> 00:26:29.160
Go ahead and censor that.

00:26:29.360 --> 00:26:31.360
Like this?

00:26:32.670 --> 00:26:34.990
Yes, it matters if the product is photographed.

00:26:34.990 --> 00:26:36.850
Give the performer a good censor too...

00:26:36.850 --> 00:26:38.890
Wait, this is not an AV!

00:26:38.890 --> 00:26:40.330
You know so much.

00:26:41.150 --> 00:26:43.740
Oh, I thought of a good idea.

00:26:43.740 --> 00:26:46.750
Listening to the sound of my own voice is kinda embarrassing.

00:26:46.750 --> 00:26:49.220
Tsuda's embarrassing sounds?!

00:26:49.640 --> 00:26:51.250
Is that all you hear?!

00:26:51.250 --> 00:26:54.470
Ha.. Ha.. Ha.. i...

00:26:54.470 --> 00:26:56.570
Don't repeat that line!

00:26:58.020 --> 00:26:59.750
Is that how it ends?
